<div class="iq-acc" id="sec0">
<input type="radio" name="iq-acc" id="iq0" class="iq-toggle" checked>
<label class="iq-label" for="iq0">1. Getting Your Account &amp; Logging In</label>
<div class="iq-body"><div class="iq-inner">
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 1 – Apply:</strong> If you don't have an account yet, click <strong>BECOME A RESELLER</strong> in the top menu, fill out the application form, and send it to us.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 2 – Approval:</strong> We'll review your application and set up your account. You'll receive a confirmation once it's approved.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 3 – Log in:</strong> Come back to inkquest.ca, click the account icon (person symbol) at the top-right, and log in using your <strong>registered email address</strong>.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 4:</strong> Once logged in, you'll see the <strong>Ink Quest – Canada Reseller Portal</strong> dashboard with a greeting and your account summary.</div>
<div class="iq-tip"><strong>Tip:</strong> Use the <strong>EN / FR</strong> buttons at the top-right to switch between English and French.</div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="iq-acc" id="sec1">
<input type="radio" name="iq-acc" id="iq1" class="iq-toggle">
<label class="iq-label" for="iq1">2. Finding Products</label>
<div class="iq-body"><div class="iq-inner">
<p><strong>Top menu:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>WHO WE ARE</strong> – Learn about InkQuest and our story.</li>
<li><strong>WHAT WE SELL</strong> – Browse products by category (toner, ink, printers, and more).</li>
<li><strong>WHERE WE ARE</strong> – Our store locations across Canada.</li>
<li><strong>BECOME A RESELLER</strong> – New here? Fill out the application form on this page to request an account.</li>
<li><strong>SPECIAL ORDER REQ.</strong> – Request a product you can't find on the website.</li>
<li><strong>CONTACT US</strong> – Get in touch with our team.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Search:</strong> Type a product name, SKU, cartridge code (e.g. CF362A), or printer model into the search bar at the top of every page.</p>
<p><strong>Browse:</strong> Use the <strong>WHAT WE SELL</strong> menu to browse by category.</p>
<p><strong>Product pages:</strong> Each product page shows cartridge details, compatible printers, and pricing. Click <strong>Add to Cart</strong> to add it to your order.</p>
<div class="iq-tip"><strong>Tip:</strong> Save items you buy often to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> (star icon) so you can find them quickly next time.</div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="iq-acc" id="sec2">
<input type="radio" name="iq-acc" id="iq2" class="iq-toggle">
<label class="iq-label" for="iq2">3. Placing an Order</label>
<div class="iq-body"><div class="iq-inner">
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Add products to your cart from product pages or search results.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Click the cart icon (top-right) to review your items. Adjust quantities if needed.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 3:</strong> If you're ordering against a purchase order, enter your <strong>PO Number</strong> in the Purchase Order Number field on the cart page.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 4:</strong> Click <strong>Checkout</strong>, enter your shipping and payment details, and place your order.</div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="iq-acc gold" id="sec3">
<input type="radio" name="iq-acc" id="iq3" class="iq-toggle">
<label class="iq-label" for="iq3">4. Uploading a Purchase Order (Fastest Way to Order)</label>
<div class="iq-body"><div class="iq-inner">
<p>Instead of adding items one by one, upload your purchase order file and we'll fill your cart automatically — the fastest way to place a large order.</p>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 1 – Upload:</strong> Go to the <strong>Upload Purchase Order</strong> page. Drag &amp; drop your PO file, or click <strong>Choose file</strong>. Accepted files: <strong>PDF, XLS, XLSX</strong> (max 10 MB).</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 2 – Review:</strong> We read your file and match every line to our catalog. Check the matched items, adjust quantities, and remove anything you don't need. Your <strong>PO number</strong> is detected automatically — you can edit it if needed.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 3 – Add to cart:</strong> Click <strong>Add matched items to cart</strong>. Everything goes into your cart at once, with your PO number attached.</div>
<div class="iq-step"><strong>Step 4 – Checkout:</strong> Review your cart and check out as normal. Your PO number is already filled in.</div>
<div class="iq-tip"><strong>Tip:</strong> Not sure about the format? Click <strong>Download a sample PO</strong> on the upload page to see an example file.</div>
<div class="iq-gray">
<strong>Good to know:</strong>
<ul style="margin: 8px 0;">
<li>Scanned or photo PDFs can't be read — please use a PDF with selectable text or an Excel file.</li>
<li>If a product code matches more than one product, we'll ask you to pick the right one.</li>
<li>Lines we can't match are shown separately and are <strong>not</strong> added to your cart.</li>
<li>The ship-to address shown on the upload page is for reference — you'll enter the final shipping address at checkout.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="iq-acc" id="sec4">
<input type="radio" name="iq-acc" id="iq4" class="iq-toggle">
<label class="iq-label" for="iq4">5. Your Reseller Dashboard</label>
<div class="iq-body"><div class="iq-inner">
<p>After logging in, your dashboard gives you quick access to everything. The <strong>Overview</strong> shows your account summary at a glance:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Open Orders</strong> – Orders not yet fulfilled.</li>
<li><strong>MTD Spend</strong> – Your total spending for the current month.</li>
<li><strong>Lifetime Spend</strong> – Your all-time total with us.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Recent Orders</strong> lists your latest orders with these columns:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Order</strong> – The order number (click to see details).</li>
<li><strong>Date</strong> – When the order was placed.</li>
<li><strong>PO Number</strong> – The purchase order number attached to the order.</li>
<li><strong>Ship To Name</strong> – Where the order is being shipped.</li>
<li><strong>Total</strong> – The order total.</li>
<li><strong>Status</strong> – Current status (e.g. pending, fulfilled).</li>
</ul>
<p>Click <strong>View all</strong> to see your full order history. The sidebar gives you:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Overview</strong> – Account summary: open orders, monthly and lifetime spend.</li>
<li><strong>Orders</strong> – Order history and tracking.</li>
<li><strong>Quick Re-Order</strong> – Re-order previous items without searching again.</li>
<li><strong>Upload PO</strong> – Upload a purchase order file to fill your cart automatically.</li>
<li><strong>Wishlist</strong> – Products you've saved for later.</li>
<li><strong>New Arrivals</strong> – The latest products added to our catalog.</li>
<li><strong>Special Order Request</strong> – Request a product you can't find on the website.</li>
<li><strong>RMA English / RMA French</strong> – Start a return or warranty claim.</li>
<li><strong>Invoices</strong> – View and download your invoices.</li>
<li><strong>Profile</strong> – Update your contact details or password.</li>
<li><strong>Address</strong> – Manage your saved shipping addresses.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Managing Your Account</strong></p>
<p><strong>Profile:</strong> Go to <strong>Profile</strong> in the dashboard sidebar to update your contact details or change your password.<br>
<strong>Addresses:</strong> Go to <strong>Address</strong> to add, edit, or remove shipping addresses. The address you choose at checkout is the one your order ships to.</p>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="iq-acc" id="sec5">
<input type="radio" name="iq-acc" id="iq5" class="iq-toggle">
<label class="iq-label" for="iq5">6. Helpful Links &amp; Contact</label>
<div class="iq-body"><div class="iq-inner">
<p>At the bottom of every page you'll find quick links:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Company:</strong> About Us, Contact Us, Brand We Carry, Privacy Policy, Website guide (this page).</li>
<li><strong>Customer service:</strong> Warranty, RMA/Return, Shipping, Terms &amp; Conditions, Our Catalog, FAQ.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Join Our Newsletter:</strong> Enter your email in the newsletter box at the bottom of the page and click <strong>Subscribe</strong> to get updates, special offers, and more. You can also follow us on <strong>Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn</strong>.</p>
<div class="iq-contact">
<p><strong>Edmonton, AB</strong> — 1-800-661-9855<br>
<strong>Richmond, BC</strong> — 1-800-661-9855<br>
<strong>St-Eustache, QC</strong> — 1-877-275-5263</p>
<p style="margin:0;">Or use the <strong>CONTACT US</strong> link in the top menu. For returns and warranty, see <strong>RMA/Return</strong> under Customer Service at the bottom of any page.</p>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>

